An umbrella distribution over algovoi-keystone-connect and algovoi-keystone-agent,
plus the `keystone` command line. Built on the AlgoVoi substrate: RFC 8785 (JCS)
canonicalisation + SHA-256, producing content-addressed evidence recomputable offline.
